- BREAKING: Removed the deprecated `POST /api/v1/fleet/hosts/:id/configuration_profiles/resend/:profile_uuid` endpoint. The path now returns 410. Use `POST /api/v1/fleet/hosts/:id/configuration_profiles/:profile_uuid/resend` instead.
- BREAKING: Removed the deprecated `GET /api/v1/fleet/scripts/batch/summary/:batch_execution_id` endpoint. The path now returns 410. Use `GET /api/v1/fleet/scripts/batch/:batch_execution_id` instead.
- BREAKING: Removed the `GET /api/v1/fleet/hosts/identifier/:identifier` endpoint. The path now returns 410. Use `GET /api/v1/fleet/hosts/:id`, which accepts a host ID or a host identifier (serial number, UUID, hostname, osquery host ID, or node key). API-only users granted the removed endpoint are granted `GET /api/v1/fleet/hosts/:id` instead. GitOps users can no longer look up a host ID by identifier.
